nicom i trgom za manifestacije","Novi kompleks imaće mlečnu halu, prostor za meso i mesne prerađevine, trg za sajmove hrane, više od 50 parking mesta...","Novi kompleks imaće mlečnu halu, prostor za meso i mesne prerađevine, trg za sajmove hrane, više od 50 parking mesta i gotovo 2.000 kvadrata natkrivenog prostora.","2026-05-31T06:30:00","31.05.2026. / 06:30","31.05.2026.",{"ImageId":635,"Description":11,"CopyRight":636,"ImageUrl":637,"ThumbnailUrl":638,"MediumImageUrl":639,"AltText":640,"Variations":641},2572461,"Gradska opština Surčin","https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2572461?ts=2026-05-30T09:29:56","https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2572461/thumbnail?ts=2026-05-30T09:29:56","https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2572461/medium?ts=2026-05-30T09:29:56","pijaca.jpg",[642,645,648,651,654],{"Name":36,"Url":643,"Width":38,"Height":644},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/108/216/2572461?ts=2026-05-30T09:29:56",67,{"Name":41,"Url":646,"Width":43,"Height":647},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/226/452/2572461?ts=2026-05-30T09:29:56",141,{"Name":46,"Url":649,"Width":48,"Height":650},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/468/936/2572461?ts=2026-05-30T09:29:56",292,{"Name":51,"Url":652,"Width":53,"Height":653},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/688/1376/2572461?ts=2026-05-30T09:29:56",429,{"Name":56,"Url":655,"Width":58,"Height":656},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/1024/2048/2572461?ts=2026-05-30T09:29:56",639,"https://biznis.kurir.rs/info-biz/10009262/beograd-gradi-novu-modernu-pijacu-investicija-vredna-411-miliona-dinara",[659,664],{"FirstName":660,"LastName":661,"AuthorId":662,"PhotoUrl":11,"AuthorUrl":663,"AuthorTypeId":285,"Hidden":5},"Kurir","Web",15794,"https://biznis.kurir.rs/autor/15794/kurir-web",{"FirstName":665,"LastName":666,"AuthorTypeId":285,"Hidden":25},"\u0015#\u0000\u0005Ř","\u0014+\u000e\u001f]\rŕ",[668,678,682,690,692,700,702,704,706,760,762,764,766,768,770,857,859,863,866,869],{"Image":669,"Type":676,"Name":677},{"ImageId":635,"Description":11,"CopyRight":636,"ImageUrl":637,"ThumbnailUrl":638,"MediumImageUrl":639,"AltText":640,"Alignment":11,"Variations":670},[671,672,673,674,675],{"Name":36,"Url":643,"Width":38,"Height":644},{"Name":41,"Url":646,"Width":43,"Height":647},{"Name":46,"Url":649,"Width":48,"Height":650},{"Name":51,"Url":652,"Width":53,"Height":653},{"Name":56,"Url":655,"Width":58,"Height":656},"Image","Big Image",{"Text":679,"Type":680,"Name":681}," \u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"https://kurir.rs/tag/132/beograd\" target=\"_blank\">Beograd\u003C/a> bi uskoro mogao da dobije jednu od najsavremenijih pijaca, pošto je za izgradnju novog pijačnog kompleksa u \u003Ca href=\"https://kurir.rs/tag/472605/surcin\" target=\"_blank\">Surčinu\u003C/a> izdata građevinska dozvola. Investitor projekta je Grad Beograd, a procenjena vrednost radova iznosi 411 miliona dinara bez PDV-a.\u003C/p> ","TextEditor","Content",{"Name":681,"Type":683,"IndexPageElement":684},"IndexPageElement",{"BannerId":11,"Type":300,"Template":11,"Properties":685,"Name":11},{"BannerId":686,"SlotCodeMobile":687,"SlotDimentionsMobile":688,"ClassMobile":689,"lazyInSidebar":298,"OOP":298,"hideOnPaging":298,"showOnPagingOnly":298},"1545649311922-0","338515395/Kurir/kurir_mob_id2","300,250;336,280;320,50;250,250;320,100;fluid","placeholder250px articleBelowPoster clean-ad-wrapper",{"Text":691,"Type":680,"Name":681}," \u003Cp>Nova pijaca gradiće se na prostoru većem od 6.300 kvadratnih metara, a projekat predviđa realizaciju u dve faze.\u003C/p> ",{"Name":681,"Type":683,"IndexPageElement":693},{"Script":11,"Type":694,"Template":683,"Properties":695,"Name":11},"Midas",{"Id":696,"src":697,"srcBiznis":698,"srcZdravlje":699,"disableOnCommentPage":298,"disableOnArticlePage":298,"hideWidgetHeader":298,"lazyInSidebar":298},"midasWidget__11538","https://cdn2.midas-network.com/Scripts/midasWidget-7-2198-12231.js","https://cdn2.midas-network.com/Scripts/midasWidget-9-1628-11538.js","https://cdn2.midas-network.com/Scripts/midasWidget-7-1933-11642.js",{"Text":701,"Type":680,"Name":681}," \u003Cp>U prvoj fazi biće izgrađen centralni natkriveni objekat višenamenskog karaktera površine 2.025 kvadratnih metara. U okviru kompleksa nalaziće se \u003Cstrong>plato sa tezgama\u003C/strong>, \u003Cstrong>mlečna hala\u003C/strong>, \u003Cstrong>hala za meso i mesne prerađevine\u003C/strong>, \u003Cstrong>administrativni deo\u003C/strong>,\u003Cstrong> toaleti\u003C/strong> i \u003Cstrong>magacinski prostori\u003C/strong>.\u003C/p> ",{"Text":703,"Type":680,"Name":681}," \u003Cp>Posebna pažnja posvećena je uređenju otvorenog prostora. Na zapadnoj strani parcele planiran je \u003Cstrong>višenamenski trg\u003C/strong> koji će, osim svakodnevne upotrebe, moći da ugosti\u003Cstrong> sajmove hrane i različite manifestacije\u003C/strong>. Prostor će biti oplemenjen \u003Cstrong>urbanim mobilijarom i zelenilom\u003C/strong>.\u003C/p> ",{"Text":705,"Type":680,"Name":681}," \u003Cp>U istočnom delu kompleksa predviđen je \u003Cstrong>parking sa 54 mesta\u003C/strong>, dok će druga faza projekta obuhvatiti dodatni plato sa tezgama na otvorenom, gde je planirano postavljanje još 50 pijačnih tezgi.\u003C/p> ",{"RelatedNewsTitle":707,"RelatedNewsTemplate":11,"Alignment":11,"RelatedNewsElements":708,"Type":759,"Name":681},"Ne propustite",[709,734],{"Document":710,"Url":714,"Title":712},{"DocumentId":711,"Title":712,"ShortDescription":713,"ParentMenuItemName":311,"RootMenuItemName":311,"WebUrl":714,"DocumentTypeAlias":21,"MasterDocumentId":715,"ParentMenuItemId":314,"RootMenuItemId":314,"HasPhotoGallery":25,"LastEditDate":716,"PublishedDate":716,"PosterPhoto":717},10008281,"Imaćemo jedan od najmodernijih aerodroma u Evropi: Radovi u Surčinu u punom jeku, evo šta će se sve izgraditi i unaprediti u narednih godinu dana (FOTO)","U toku su radovi na rekonstrukciji Terminala 1 i proširenju Terminala 2, koji uključuju nove gejtove, avio-mostove i dodatne pozicije za parkiranje aviona, uz plan da aerodrom ima 37 gejtova.","https://biznis.kurir.rs/info-biz/10008281/aerodrom-nikola-tesla-u-beogradu-siri-terminale-grade-se-novi-gejtovi-i-sire-terminali-1-i-2",1554578,"2026-05-30T06:30:00",{"ImageId":718,"Description":11,"CopyRight":29,"ImageUrl":719,"ThumbnailUrl":720,"MediumImageUrl":721,"AltText":722,"Variations":723},2571601,"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2571601?ts=2026-05-29T09:43:08","https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2571601/thumbnail?ts=2026-05-29T09:43:08","https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2571601/medium?ts=2026-05-29T09:43:08","er sbija.jpg",[724,726,728,730,732],{"Name":36,"Url":725,"Width":38,"Height":39},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/108/216/2571601?ts=2026-05-29T09:43:08",{"Name":41,"Url":727,"Width":43,"Height":44},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/226/452/2571601?ts=2026-05-29T09:43:08",{"Name":46,"Url":729,"Width":48,"Height":49},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/468/936/2571601?ts=2026-05-29T09:43:08",{"Name":51,"Url":731,"Width":53,"Height":54},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/688/1376/2571601?ts=2026-05-29T09:43:08",{"Name":56,"Url":733,"Width":58,"Height":59},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/1024/2048/2571601?ts=2026-05-29T09:43:08",{"Document":735,"Url":739,"Title":737},{"DocumentId":736,"Title":737,"ShortDescription":738,"ParentMenuItemName":311,"RootMenuItemName":311,"WebUrl":739,"DocumentTypeAlias":21,"MasterDocumentId":740,"ParentMenuItemId":314,"RootMenuItemId":314,"HasPhotoGallery":25,"LastEditDate":741,"PublishedDate":741,"PosterPhoto":742},9999285,"Niče \"nevidljiva\" zgrada na Ušću: Po njenom krovu moći ćete i da trčite, ispod šume čuvaće najvrednije blago našeg područja - ovako će izgledati muzej u zemlji","U sklopu priprema za Ekspo 2027, Beograd dobija moderni Prirodnjački muzej sa zelenim krovom i bogatom zbirkom od dva miliona predmeta.","https://biznis.kurir.rs/info-biz/9999285/kako-ce-izgledati-prirodnjacki-muzej-na-uscu-transformacija-parka",1549560,"2026-05-24T08:00:00",{"ImageId":743,"Description":11,"CopyRight":29,"ImageUrl":744,"ThumbnailUrl":745,"MediumImageUrl":746,"AltText":747,"Variations":748},2563730,"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2563730?ts=2026-05-19T15:50:44","https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2563730/thumbnail?ts=2026-05-19T15:50:44","https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2563730/medium?ts=2026-05-19T15:50:44","Prirodnjački muzej zgrada Ušće megaprojekat",[749,751,753,755,757],{"Name":36,"Url":750,"Width":38,"Height":39},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/108/216/2563730?ts=2026-05-19T15:50:44",{"Name":41,"Url":752,"Width":43,"Height":44},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/226/452/2563730?ts=2026-05-19T15:50:44",{"Name":46,"Url":754,"Width":48,"Height":49},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/468/936/2563730?ts=2026-05-19T15:50:44",{"Name":51,"Url":756,"Width":53,"Height":54},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/688/1376/2563730?ts=2026-05-19T15:50:44",{"Name":56,"Url":758,"Width":58,"Height":59},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/1024/2048/2563730?ts=2026-05-19T15:50:44","RelatedNews",{"Text":761,"Type":680,"Name":681}," \u003Cp>Prema projektnoj dokumentaciji, ukupna površina zelenih površina iznosi više od 670 kvadratnih metara, dok će najveći deo kompleksa činiti \u003Cstrong>moderno uređeni platoi\u003C/strong>, natkriveni prodajni prostori i saobraćajna infrastruktura.\u003C/p> ",{"Text":763,"Type":680,"Name":681}," \u003Cp>Projekat se realizuje u okviru programa \"Partnerstvo za lokalni razvoj\", koji Republika Srbija sprovodi uz podršku Evropske investicione banke i Programa Ujedinjenih nacija za razvoj (UNDP), sa ciljem unapređenja lokalne infrastrukture i kvaliteta života građana.\u003C/p> ",{"Text":765,"Type":680,"Name":681}," \u003Cp>Tehničku dokumentaciju za projekat izradila je kompanija BHL Projekt iz Beograda.\u003C/p> ",{"Text":767,"Type":680,"Name":681}," \u003Cp>Građevinska dozvola predviđa da\u003Cstrong> radovi počnu u roku od tri godine\u003C/strong> od pravosnažnosti rešenja, dok je rok za izdavanje upotrebne dozvole pet godina.\u003C/p> ",{"Text":769,"Type":680,"Name":681}," \u003Cp>Kurir.rs\u003C/p> ",{"RelatedNewsTitle":707,"RelatedNewsTemplate":11,"Alignment":11,"RelatedNewsElements":771,"Type":759,"Name":681,"lastRelatedNewsElement":25},[772,797,806,831],{"Document":773,"Url":777,"Title":775},{"DocumentId":774,"Title":775,"ShortDescription":776,"ParentMenuItemName":311,"RootMenuItemName":311,"WebUrl":777,"DocumentTypeAlias":21,"MasterDocumentId":778,"ParentMenuItemId":314,"RootMenuItemId":314,"HasPhotoGallery":25,"LastEditDate":779,"PublishedDate":779,"PosterPhoto":780},10008792,"Jug Srbije bruji o dolasku Kineza: Šta investicije znače za radnike \"Jumka\" i \"Simpa\"","Posao u tim fabrikama je sigurniji za radnike zato što Kinezi dolaze da ostanu, rekao je prof. dr Ljubodrag Savić, sindikat Jumka zakazao sastanak za ponedeljak.","https://biznis.kurir.rs/info-biz/10008792/sta-ce-kineske-investicije-znaciti-za-radnike-jumka-i-simpa",1554874,"2026-05-30T07:15:00",{"ImageId":781,"Description":11,"CopyRight":29,"ImageUrl":782,"ThumbnailUrl":783,"MediumImageUrl":784,"AltText":785,"Variations":786},2572016,"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2572016?ts=2026-05-29T14:28:45","https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2572016/thumbnail?ts=2026-05-29T14:28:45","https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2572016/medium?ts=2026-05-29T14:28:45","Jumko Simpo.jpg",[787,789,791,793,795],{"Name":36,"Url":788,"Width":38,"Height":39},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/108/216/2572016?ts=2026-05-29T14:28:45",{"Name":41,"Url":790,"Width":43,"Height":44},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/226/452/2572016?ts=2026-05-29T14:28:45",{"Name":46,"Url":792,"Width":48,"Height":49},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/468/936/2572016?ts=2026-05-29T14:28:45",{"Name":51,"Url":794,"Width":53,"Height":54},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/688/1376/2572016?ts=2026-05-29T14:28:45",{"Name":56,"Url":796,"Width":58,"Height":59},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/1024/2048/2572016?ts=2026-05-29T14:28:45",{"Document":798,"Url":714,"Title":712},{"DocumentId":711,"Title":712,"ShortDescription":713,"ParentMenuItemName":311,"RootMenuItemName":311,"WebUrl":714,"DocumentTypeAlias":21,"MasterDocumentId":715,"ParentMenuItemId":314,"RootMenuItemId":314,"HasPhotoGallery":25,"LastEditDate":716,"PublishedDate":716,"PosterPhoto":799},{"ImageId":718,"Description":11,"CopyRight":29,"ImageUrl":719,"ThumbnailUrl":720,"MediumImageUrl":721,"AltText":722,"Variations":800},[801,802,803,804,805],{"Name":36,"Url":725,"Width":38,"Height":39},{"Name":41,"Url":727,"Width":43,"Height":44},{"Name":46,"Url":729,"Width":48,"Height":49},{"Name":51,"Url":731,"Width":53,"Height":54},{"Name":56,"Url":733,"Width":58,"Height":59},{"Document":807,"Url":811,"Title":809},{"DocumentId":808,"Title":809,"ShortDescription":810,"ParentMenuItemName":311,"RootMenuItemName":311,"WebUrl":811,"DocumentTypeAlias":21,"MasterDocumentId":812,"ParentMenuItemId":314,"RootMenuItemId":314,"LastEditDate":813,"PublishedDate":813,"PosterPhoto":814},10008527,"Nemačka ima više nezaposlenih nego što 15 evropskih zemalja ima stanovnika: Uprkos blagom padu, tržište rada i dalje pod pritiskom","U maju zabeležen pad nezaposlenosti na 2,95 miliona, ali je broj i dalje viši nego pre godinu dana, dok Savezna agencija za rad upozorava da sezonsko poboljšanje ne znači stabilan oporavak tržišta rada.","https://biznis.kurir.rs/info-biz/10008527/broj-nezaposlenih-u-nemackoj-pao-ispod-tri-miliona-ali-trziste-rada-i-dalje-bez-jasnog-oporavka",1554720,"2026-05-30T05:45:00",{"ImageId":815,"Description":11,"CopyRight":29,"ImageUrl":816,"ThumbnailUrl":817,"MediumImageUrl":818,"AltText":819,"Variations":820},1860780,"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/1860780?ts=2026-02-10T16:00:36","https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/1860780/thumbnail?ts=2026-02-10T16:00:36","https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/1860780/medium?ts=2026-02-10T16:00:36","Mladić sedi na stepenice i drži se za glavu",[821,823,825,827,829],{"Name":36,"Url":822,"Width":