:11},[971,1046,1089],{"DocumentId":972,"Title":973,"ShortDescription":974,"RootMenuItemId":975,"RootMenuItemName":976,"ParentMenuItemId":977,"ParentMenuItemName":978,"LastEditDate":979,"PublishedDate":979,"LastEditDateLongFormatted":980,"LastEditDateShortFormatted":981,"PosterPhoto":982,"WebUrl":1036,"DocumentAttributes":1037,"MasterDocumentId":1039,"DocumentTypeAlias":1040,"CardType":1041,"ContentSummary":1042},21186,"Koliko će nas koštati grejanje ove zime, izašla računica za stan od 60 kvadrata: Ovo su saveti za uštedu","Prema podacima sa popisa iz 2022. godine, skoro polovina građana Srbije se greje na drva i pelet,...",37,"Energetika i životna sredina",40,"Energetska efikasnost","10/09/2026 10:56:39","09.10.2026. / 10:56","09.10.2026.",{"ImageId":983,"Description":11,"CopyRight":984,"ImageUrl":985,"ThumbnailUrl":986,"MediumImageUrl":987,"AltText":988,"Variations":989},19068,"Shutterstock","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/19068?ts=2026-10-09T10:55:08","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/19068/thumbnail?ts=2026-10-09T10:55:08","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/19068/medium?ts=2026-10-09T10:55:08","grejanje na drva",[990,992,997,1001,1006,1011,1016,1021,1026,1031],{"Name":36,"Url":991,"Width":38,"Height":39},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/108/216/19068?ts=2026-10-09T10:55:08",{"Name":993,"Url":994,"Width":995,"Height":996},"194x388","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/194/388/19068?ts=2026-10-09T10:55:08",194,129,{"Name":998,"Url":999,"Width":1000,"Height":647},"212x424","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/212/424/19068?ts=2026-10-09T10:55:08",212,{"Name":1002,"Url":1003,"Width":1004,"Height":1005},"288x576","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/288/576/19068?ts=2026-10-09T10:55:08",288,192,{"Name":1007,"Url":1008,"Width":1009,"Height":1010},"324x648","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/324/648/19068?ts=2026-10-09T10:55:08",324,216,{"Name":1012,"Url":1013,"Width":1014,"Height":1015},"396x792","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/396/792/19068?ts=2026-10-09T10:55:08",396,264,{"Name":1017,"Url":1018,"Width":1019,"Height":1020},"428x856","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/428/856/19068?ts=2026-10-09T10:55:08",428,285,{"Name":1022,"Url":1023,"Width":1024,"Height":1025},"592x1184","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/592/1184/19068?ts=2026-10-09T10:55:08",592,395,{"Name":1027,"Url":1028,"Width":1029,"Height":1030},"960x1920","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/960/1920/19068?ts=2026-10-09T10:55:08",960,640,{"Name":1032,"Url":1033,"Width":1034,"Height":1035},"1280x2560","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/1280/2560/19068?ts=2026-10-09T10:55:08",1200,800,"https://eupravozato.mondo.rs/energetika-i-zivotna-sredina/energetska-efikasnost/a21186/koliko-ce-nas-kostati-grejanje-ove-zime-izasla-racunica-za-stan-od-60-kvadrata.html",[1038],{"Text":867,"Type":861,"Name":868},21206,"ArticleBigImage","B",[1043,1044,1045],"Agencija za energetiku Srbije izračunala je troškove grejanja za stan od 60 kvadrata u kome živi četvoročlana porodica.","Najjeftiniji su gas i drva, oko 60.000 dinara po sezoni, dok pelet košta oko 114.000, a direktno grejanje na struju može da dostigne 250.000 dinara.","Stručnjaci savetuju kupovinu efikasnijih uređaja i bolju izolaciju, jer to može znatno da smanji račun za grejanje.",{"DocumentId":1047,"Title":1048,"ShortDescription":1049,"RootMenuItemId":975,"RootMenuItemName":976,"ParentMenuItemId":1050,"ParentMenuItemName":1051,"LastEditDate":1052,"PublishedDate":1052,"LastEditDateLongFormatted":1053,"LastEditDateShortFormatted":981,"PosterPhoto":1054,"WebUrl":1081,"DocumentAttributes":1082,"MasterDocumentId":1084,"DocumentTypeAlias":1040,"CardType":1041,"ContentSummary":1085},21183,"Da li vrelo leto znači da ćemo imati i ledenu zimu? Posle El Ninja, sad se pominje i polarni vrtlog","Ovaj vremenski fenomen će dostići vrhunac tek krajem jeseni ili početkom zime.",42,"Klimatske promene","10/09/2026 10:20:51","09.10.2026. / 10:20",{"ImageId":1055,"Description":11,"CopyRight":984,"ImageUrl":1056,"ThumbnailUrl":1057,"MediumImageUrl":1058,"AltText":1059,"Variations":1060},19064,"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/19064/thumbnail?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/19064/medium?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28","žene se probijaju kroz mećavu i sneg",[1061,1063,1065,1067,1069,1071,1073,1075,1077,1079],{"Name":36,"Url":1062,"Width":38,"Height":39},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/108/216/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28",{"Name":993,"Url":1064,"Width":995,"Height":996},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/194/388/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28",{"Name":998,"Url":1066,"Width":1000,"Height":647},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/212/424/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28",{"Name":1002,"Url":1068,"Width":1004,"Height":1005},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/288/576/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28",{"Name":1007,"Url":1070,"Width":1009,"Height":1010},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/324/648/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28",{"Name":1012,"Url":1072,"Width":1014,"Height":1015},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/396/792/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28",{"Name":1017,"Url":1074,"Width":1019,"Height":1020},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/428/856/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28",{"Name":1022,"Url":1076,"Width":1024,"Height":1025},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/592/1184/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28",{"Name":1027,"Url":1078,"Width":1029,"Height":1030},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/960/1920/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28",{"Name":1032,"Url":1080,"Width":1034,"Height":1035},"https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/1280/2560/19064?ts=2026-10-09T10:18:28","https://eupravozato.mondo.rs/energetika-i-zivotna-sredina/klimatske-promene/a21183/el-ninjo-i-polarni-vrtlog-da-li-vrelo-leto-znaci-da-cemo-imati-i-ledenu-zimu.html",[1083],{"Text":867,"Type":861,"Name":868},21203,[1086,1087,1088],"El Ninjo bi mogao da bude najjači do sada i da poveća šanse da 2027. bude najtoplija godina otkako se mere temperature, uz više ekstremnih vrućina i vremenskih nepogoda.","U Evropi su posledice uglavnom indirektne, ali bi kasnije ove godine mogla da uslede blaža, kišovitija i vetrovitija jesen i početak zime.","Kada El Ninjo oslabi polarni vrtlog, raste rizik od iznenadnog stratosferskog zagrevanja, koje može da donese hladnije vreme u severnoj Evropi.",{"DocumentId":1090,"Title":1091,"ShortDescription":1092,"RootMenuItemId":975,"RootMenuItemName":976,"ParentMenuItemId":977,"ParentMenuItemName":978,"LastEditDate":1093,"PublishedDate":1093,"LastEditDateLongFormatted":1094,"LastEditDateShortFormatted":1095,"PosterPhoto":1096,"WebUrl":1134,"DocumentAttributes":1135,"MasterDocumentId":1090,"DocumentTypeAlias":1040,"CardType":1041},4040,"Šta sve obavezno treba da uradimo pred zimu kako bi nam bilo toplo? \"Ko u ovo uloži, uštedeo je najviše\"","Hladno vreme je stiglo i u naše krajeve, ali se treba potruditi da hladnoća ne prodire i u naše...","11/11/2025 08:57:00","11.11.2025. / 08:57","11.11.2025.",{"ImageId":1097,"Description":1098,"CopyRight":1099,"ImageUrl":1100,"ThumbnailUrl":1101,"MediumImageUrl":1102,"AltText":1103,"Variations":1104},4438,"Kako dolazi zima treba da se postaramo da prodor hladnog vazduha u naše prostorije treba da bude na minimumu","Jochen Tack / Alamy / Alamy / Profimedia","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/4438?ts=2024-10-23T15:39:59","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/4438/thumbnail?ts=2024-10-23T15:39:59","https://staticeupravozato.mondo.rs/api/v3/images/4438/medium?ts=2024-10-23T15:39:59","Devojka leži na kauču pokrivena ćebetom dok joj se noge greju na radijatoru",[1105,1108,1111,1114,1116,1119,1122,