panici","Jeftine kopije Meta pametnih naočara postale su hit na društvenim mrežama, ali privlače pažnju iz pogrešnog razloga. Influenseri ističu jednu spornu mogućnost koja otvara ozbiljna pitanja o privatnosti i snimanju bez znanja drugih.","https://www.kurir.rs/techvision/vesti/10128625/influenseri-reklamiraju-jeftine-ai-naocare-koje-snimaju-sve",1620856,"2026-10-09T12:00:00",{"ImageId":2172,"Description":11,"CopyRight":29,"ImageUrl":2173,"ThumbnailUrl":2174,"MediumImageUrl":2175,"AltText":2176,"Variations":2177},2675689,"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2675689?ts=2026-10-09T11:17:10","https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2675689/thumbnail?ts=2026-10-09T11:17:10","https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2675689/medium?ts=2026-10-09T11:17:10","Smart Glasses in a Bustling Café.png",[2178,2180,2182,2184,2186],{"Name":36,"Url":2179,"Width":38,"Height":348},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/108/216/2675689?ts=2026-10-09T11:17:10",{"Name":41,"Url":2181,"Width":43,"Height":351},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/226/452/2675689?ts=2026-10-09T11:17:10",{"Name":46,"Url":2183,"Width":48,"Height":354},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/468/936/2675689?ts=2026-10-09T11:17:10",{"Name":51,"Url":2185,"Width":53,"Height":357},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/688/1376/2675689?ts=2026-10-09T11:17:10",{"Name":56,"Url":2187,"Width":58,"Height":360},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/1024/2048/2675689?ts=2026-10-09T11:17:10",{"DocumentId":2189,"Title":2190,"ShortDescription":2191,"ParentMenuItemName":2142,"RootMenuItemName":2093,"WebUrl":2192,"DocumentTypeAlias":21,"MasterDocumentId":2193,"ParentMenuItemId":2145,"RootMenuItemId":2097,"LastEditDate":2194,"PublishedDate":2194,"PosterPhoto":2195},10127518,"Telefon vam se odjednom brzo prazni? Stručnjak otkriva jedan od znakova hakovanja","Ako vam se telefon poslednjih dana prazni mnogo brže nego inače, nemojte odmah kriviti bateriju. Neočekivano velika potrošnja može biti jedan od znakova da neka aplikacija il