,9438661,"KURIR 5 priča","Budite u toku sa najvažnijim temama dana, prijavite se za \"KURIR 5 priča\", naš dnevni izbor najvažnijih vesti.",89,"Newsletter","2024-09-16T04:02:28","16.09.2024. / 04:02","16.09.2024.",{"ImageId":2482,"Description":11,"CopyRight":660,"ImageUrl":2483,"ThumbnailUrl":2484,"MediumImageUrl":2485,"AltText":2486,"Variations":2487},2087993,"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2087993?ts=2024-09-16T03:59:43","https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2087993/thumbnail?ts=2024-09-16T03:59:43","https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2087993/medium?ts=2024-09-16T03:59:43","newsletter-desk-no-specific-ratio@1.5x.jpg",[2488,2491,2494,2498,2500],{"Name":36,"Url":2489,"Width":38,"Height":2490},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/108/216/2087993?ts=2024-09-16T03:59:43",69,{"Name":41,"Url":2492,"Width":43,"Height":2493},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/226/452/2087993?ts=2024-09-16T03:59:43",145,{"Name":46,"Url":2495,"Width":2496,"Height":2497},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/468/936/2087993?ts=2024-09-16T03:59:43",327,210,{"Name":51,"Url":2499,"Width":2496,"Height":2497},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/688/1376/2087993?ts=2024-09-16T03:59:43",{"Name":56,"Url":2501,"Width":2496,"Height":2497},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/1024/2048/2087993?ts=2024-09-16T03:59:43","https://www.kurir.rs/newsletter/9438661/KURIR-5-prica",[2504,2507,2509,2511,2513,2516,2519,2528,2551],{"Text":2505,"Type":1629,"Name":2506},"Svakog radnog dana","Label",{"Text":2508,"Type":680,"Name":681}," \u003Cp>Odvojite samo pet minuta i obavestićemo vas o ključnim stvarima koje treba da znate svakog dana. Ovaj brz i pregledan format vam omogućava da budete u toku sa najnovijim događajima iz celog sveta, čak i kada nemate vremena za pretraživanje vesti i praćenje dešavanja u Srbiji i svetu.\u003C/p> ",{"Text":2510,"Type":680,"Name":681}," \u003Cp>KURIR 5 priča je sveobuhvatni pregled najvažnijih vesti dana, odabran za vas od strane najveće i najuticajnije redakcije u Srbiji i regionu. Direktno u vaše imejl sanduče svakog radnog dana, ujutru.\u003C/p> ",{"Text":2512,"Type":680,"Name":681}," \u003Cp>Prijavite se sada i budite uvek u toku sa najvažnijim pričama dana!\u003C/p> ",{"Text":2514,"Type":1629,"Name":2515},"kurir","Gigya Consent",{"Text":2517,"Type":1629,"Name":2518},"767b187f77","Mailchimp List ID",{"Image":2520,"Type":676,"Name":2527},{"ImageId":2482,"Description":11,"CopyRight":660,"ImageUrl":2483,"ThumbnailUrl":2484,"MediumImageUrl":2485,"AltText":2486,"Alignment":11,"Variations":2521},[2522,2523,2524,2525,2526],{"Name":36,"Url":2489,"Width":38,"Height":2490},{"Name":41,"Url":2492,"Width":43,"Height":2493},{"Name":46,"Url":2495,"Width":2496,"Height":2497},{"Name":51,"Url":2499,"Width":2496,"Height":2497},{"Name":56,"Url":2501,"Width":2496,"Height":2497},"Image 3x2",{"Image":2529,"Type":676,"Name":2550},{"ImageId":2530,"Description":11,"CopyRight":660,"ImageUrl":2531,"ThumbnailUrl":2532,"MediumImageUrl":2533,"AltText":2534,"Alignment":11,"Variations":2535},2087994,"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2087994?ts=2024-09-16T04:00:11","https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2087994/thumbnail?ts=2024-09-16T04:00:11","https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/2087994/medium?ts=2024-09-16T04:00:11","newsletter-mobile-3-1.jpg",[2536,2538,2541,2544,2547],{"Name":36,"Url":2537,"Width":38,"Height":154},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/108/216/2087994?ts=2024-09-16T04:00:11",{"Name":41,"Url":2539,"Width":43,"Height":2540},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/226/452/2087994?ts=2024-09-16T04:00:11",75,{"Name":46,"Url":2542,"Width":48,"Height":2543},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/468/936/2087994?ts=2024-09-16T04:00:11",156,{"Name":51,"Url":2545,"Width":53,"Height":2546},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/688/1376/2087994?ts=2024-09-16T04:00:11",229,{"Name":56,"Url":2548,"Width":58,"Height":2549},"https://static.kurir.rs/api/v3/images/1024/2048/2087994?ts=2024-09-16T04:00:11",341,"Image 3x1",{"Image":2552,"Type"